<title>USA: Huntsman Names J. Kimo Esplin as CFO.</title>
<headline>Huntsman Names J. Kimo Esplin as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huntsman Corp said Friday it has named J. Kimo Esplin chief financial officer and senior vice-president. Prior to joining the company in 1994, Esplin was a vice-president in the Chicago office of Bankers Trust New York Corp.</p>
<p>He assumes the position of CFO from Richard Durham, who earlier had been named president and chief executive officer.</p>
